WEBVTT

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:31.496
Jika penonton di sini berfikir

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.936
"Oh, itu bukan saya, saya tak percaya,"

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:35.256
datanglah masuk kelas saya.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:36.976
(Ketawa)

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:40.680
supaya saya boleh tunjuk berapa kerugian
setiap kali anda ikut emosi.

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:45.120
(Tepukan)

00:10:47.150 --> 00:10:49.136
Terima kasih banyak-banyak.
Terima kasih.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:50.320
(Tepukan)